<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">VALOMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa Valoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Valoma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Valo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Valoma</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo iki kya Valoma kisimbilwe na mnjagila Paulo pagati lya mwaka amsini na chitai na amsini na nane peababilwe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo akali ave seakagendeliye ku Loma ndeni akalagiche baluwa iyi neke kuvawulanicha vanu vonda, Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi, yevakumudikila Kilisito va ukoya ku Loma. Chpindi peakali asimba baluwa iyi akali akwikala mwani va ku Kolindo. Paulo akavasimbiliye vanu va inyi yonda vawese kumdikila na kumpulikicha Yesu Kilisito muwuso va 16.26.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiganulo iki kya Valoma ndi kya muhimu kwa vanu yevamudikiye Kilisito kila pono na kila chipindi kwakuva kihumulila kw wachi petukombolilwa kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito. Ndeni ndeni Paulo kawunganisa Njowo Chinofu cha Yesu Kilisito na Lyagano lya dahila. Vakwimba vongofu valumbana kuva, msitali veugehe mkomi mu kiganulo ikyo ndi muwuso va 1.16 yilonga, sendiwona nyoni kudalika Njowo chinofu, kwakuva chigehe na ludali lwa Nguluvi kumlowa kila munu yeakuidikila, kwa Vayawudi tandi, kangi kwa vanu se Vayawudi. Pono lya kwanja lya kiganulo kya Loma wuso va 1-12, ihumulila umanyi va Nguluvi, pono lya uvili wuso va 13-15, ihumulila magito gyolofu pevang'ang'wa vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito vakale.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo avanga baluwa lyake kwa kwitambucha yumwene na kulonga akuvasimbiliya va ani wuso va 1.1-15.</para>
  <para style="io">Baho Paulo ihumulila namuna vanu pevang'ang'wa kwikala na petukomboliwa kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito wuso va 1.16—11.36.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ihumulila magito gyolofu pevang'ang'wa vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito vakale wuso va 12.1—15.13.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akumalila kusimba kwa kuvahungila vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Loma wuso va 16.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Nene Paulo, mchulila va Kilisito Yesu, yendihaguliwe na kukemelwa na Nguluvi kwa kuvadalikila vanu Njowo chake Chinofu.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Njowo ichi Chinofu nde chejangile Nguluvi kuhuma dahila, kuchumbila vavichi vake, ngita peisimbilwe mu masimbo ga Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Njowo ichi Chinofu chikumuhumulila Mwana va Nguluvi, Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, mwene akali munu kwa kubabwa mulukolo lwa Dawudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Kwa umwimike va Muhe va Nguluvi akamuwonesile kuva Mwana va Nguluvi kwa uchulubuko vake kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe, uyu nde Yesu Kilisito Mtwa vetu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kuchumbila mwene Kilisito, anigavile usangi ndiveche mnjagila, ndivalongoche vanu va inyi yonda neke vawese kudikila na kupulikicha. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ndeni ndeni nyenye yemwikala ku mwani va Loma, yemukemeliwe muveche vanu va Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Nondee, ndikuvasimbiliya nyenye vonda yemwikala ku mwani va Loma yemukeliwe na Nguluvi, akavahaguwe muveche vanu vake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Ndikuvasukila kwa Nguluvi Daada vetu na Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito avagavile usanzi na lutengamaso.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumlumba Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ndikumuhongecha tandi Nguluvi vangu kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito kwakuva lya nyenye vonda, kwakuva vanu vonda va inyi vapulike ludikilo lwenu. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nguluvi yendikumgumbanikila kwa numbula lyangu lyonda kwa kudalika Njowo Chinofu cha Mwana vake, ndi mswida vangu kuva ndikuvawiwuka, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />kila pendisuka. Ndikumsuka Nguluvi agite ngita peikela, anigite ndiwese kuvagendelela nyenye. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Kwakuva ndidoboka hilo kuvagendelela nyenye, neke ndipatile kuvatanga muludikilo lwenu neke muveche vakangafu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ndisaka kulonga endee, vonda nyenye pamwi na nene twigangamiche, ludikilo lwangu lwa Nguluvi livagangamiche nyenye na ludikilo lwenu kwa Nguluvi linigangamiche nene. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Valongo vangu, ndisaka muchele kuva mala chongofu dandisakile kuvagendelela, ila kigehe kinu kyekinikanile mpaka nondee. Nganikela ndivapate vanu yevakumdikila Kilisito kuhuma kwa nyenye ngita pendivapatile vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito yese Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Nding'ang'wa kuvadalikila vanu Njowo chinofu vala Vagiliki na yese Vagiliki na vala vevakwimbile na sevakwimbile. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ndeni nene, ndidoboka hilo kuvadalikila Njowo Chinofu kwa nyenye yemwikala ukoya ku mwani va Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo Chinofu cha Kilisito igehe na ludali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Sendiwona nyoni kudalika Njowo chinofu, kwakuva chigehe na ludali lwa Nguluvi kuvalowa kila munu yeakuidikila, kwa Vayawudi tandi, kangi kwa vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Kwakuva Njowo chinofu chiwonesa wachi kuva Nguluvi peavakuvagita vanu kuva vasanzi pautalo lyake kwa ng'asi lya kudikila, kuvangila pamwandi mbaka kumwiso, ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, “Munu musanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi dakwikala kwa kudikila.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luvipo lwa Nguluvi kwa vanu vevagehe na sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nguluvi agubutile luvipo lwake kuhuma paluhano kwa vanu vonda vevagita sambi na uwofu vonda va vanu vevakuwupinja undakyene ubihile kucheleka kwa uwofu vawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Kwakuva, makani gyonda gyegikumugita Nguluvi achelwe kwa vene gagehe wachi. Nguluvi yumwene agawonese wachi kwa vene. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Kuvangila Nguluvi peawumbile inyi, umwimike vake va mbepali na unguluvi vake, uvikilwe wachi ata ngita vibihila kuwoneka kwa meho, ila vanu viwesa kuchela umwimike va makani ago kwa kugalola finu fyawumbile. Ndeni vanu seviwesa kwitasa. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ata ngita vakumchela Nguluvi, ila sevakumginya ngita Nguluvi vala sevakumuhongecha, ila luhala lwao lwavikilwe kisi ata sevawesile kuchela unanzi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Vakwidumba kuva vana luhala ila vapufi. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Vilekile kumnjuma Nguluvi yeakwikala mbepali, ila vakunjuma vang'omong'omo chechigalanichwa ngita munu yesekwikala mbepali na vang'omong'omo ga vang'oko na fidege na fiwumbe fyefikwambala.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Ndeni, Nguluvi akavalekile vadoboke hilo munumbula chawo na vayigitile makani ga nyoni mumivili gyawo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Vakalekile kudikila undakyene va Nguluvi na kufwata udesi, vakalekile kumginya na kumgundamila Nguluvi yeing'ang'wa kunjumwa mbepali! Ndakyene.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Kwa ndeni, Nguluvi avalekile vakovikele ludoboko chawo njanganifu. Ata vadala valekile kugona na vagosi vawo ngita Nguluvi peikela, vakayidobokile vavene kwa vavene. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ndeni ndeni vagosi valeka kugona na vadala vao ngita Nguluvi pevavawumbile, vakayidobokela vavene kwa vavene. Vagosi vayigitile makani ga nyoni, ndeni vakayikovekele vavene lihigilo kwa mawofu gevagitile. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kwakuva vanu avo vakakanile kumchela Nguluvi, Nguluvi akavalekile vakovikele luhala chawo chihofu, vakagitile gala segang'ang'ilwe kugitwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Vanu ava, vamemile makani manjanganifu, uwofu, kusaka kila kinu kiveche kyako, ludobokelo njanganifu, wifu, kudocha vanu, ndewo, kuchanga vanu, mahocho manjanganifu na kuheha, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />na vakwilata kwa udesi na vakumvipila Nguluvi na yevagehe na kidada na vikwinjuma na kwidumba na veving'ang'a mawofu na sevakuvadikila vasasi vawo, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />na vihela luhala na vevidenya lyagano na sevakwikela na vihela lusungu kwa vanu vangi. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Na vachela kuva malagilicho ga Nguluvi, isimbilwe kuva vanu vevigita makani ngita aga vang'ang'wa kudochwa. Ila sevigita makani ago hela, ila vakwidikila navo vevigita makani ngita ago.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Lihigo lwa undakyene lwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Suwe, veve mganja vangu, ngita ukuvahiga vayago sedamuwesa kwitasa ata ngita veve nde ani. Kwakuva pevakuvahiga vayago kuno veve wigita galagala vevigita, ukwihiga yumwene. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Twichela kuva lihigo lya Nguluvi ndi lya undakyene pala peakuvahiga vanu vevigita makani ngita ago. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Ila veve mganja yewukuvahiga vala vevigita makani manjanganifu na veve ukugagita ago, wuli wihocha dawiyepa lihigo lya Nguluvi? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Awu ukuubeda usanzi vake mkomi na luhuvililo lwake, wuli, sewichela kuva usanzi va Nguluvi ukukulongocha uwese kuleka sambi na umuwuyile Nguluvi? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ila veve ugehe na numbula kangafu na kidada kya kuleka mawofu, ndeni ukwivikila luvipo ngomi lya Nguluvi mu kigono kila kya kuhigwa kyekihela umwilila daigubutuliwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Kigono ikyo Nguluvi dakumuhomba kila munu kuhumana na gala gyeagitile. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Vanu vala veviendelela kugita manofu vasaka kuginywa hilo na Nguluvi na kuwanuka uwumi veseuhanangika. Nguluvi daakuvagavila uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Ila vanu vevisaka finu fyaweka na valema undakyene va Nguluvi, neke vakovekele mawofu, ndakyene davakumgita Nguluvi avipe na mwene davakuvahiga. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Ndeni ndeni dakuvecha na magudo na matunila dagikumpata kila munu yeigita mawofu. Dagakuvapata tandi Vayawudi na kangi kwa Vagiliki. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Ila Nguluvi daakuvanjuma na daakuvadikila na kuvagavila lutengamaso vanu vala vevigita manofu, tandi kwa Vayawudi na kangi kwa vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Kwakuva Nguluvi ihela umwilila kwa munu yeyonda yula.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Kwakuva vanu vonda vevigita mawofu ata ngita sevachela malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa davahigwa. Na vala vevigita mawofu kuno vachela malagilicho davahigwa kwa malagilicho gago. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Kwakuva sevala vevapulikicha malagilocho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa nde vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi, ila vala vevakudikila malagilicho nde vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Vanu se Vayawudi sevachela malagilicho ago. Ila ngita vigita makani manofu kwa kulongochwa na numbula chawo ngita malagilicho peing'ang'a, davavecha vigita gala geging'ang'wa na malagilicho. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Kyanda lyawo iwonesa kuva lila lyeling'ang'ilwa na malagilicho, isimbilwe munumbula chawo. Na umwimike vao va kugita manofu na manjanganifu chiwonesa wachi lukani lulo na mahocho gyawo chikuvahiga na chipindi chingi chikuvatasa. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ndeni daivecha kigono kya lihigo, Nguluvi davakuvahiga vanu ata kwa mahaocho gawo ga lupwepo kwa ng'asi lya Yesu Kilisito. Ngita peilonga Njowo chinofu chendidalika.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi na Malagilicho ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Ila veve ukwikemela Muyawudi, ukuhuvilila Malagilicho na kwidumba kuva veve ndi munu va Nguluvi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />wichela gala Nguluvi gyeakela ugagite na wiwesa kuhagula makani gegakumkelesa Nguluvi kwakuva malagilicho gakuwulaniche, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />veve ukwiwona kuva ukuvalongocha vevabofwike mewo na welu kwa vala vevagehe mukisi. <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Veve ukwiwona muwulanicha va vapufi na vala sevikwimbile. Kwakuva unago malagilicho, ndeni wihocha wichela kila kinu na undakyene vonda. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Suwe, veve ukuvawulanicha vayago, kwa liki uyiwulaniche yuve? Ukuvadalikila veyago, “Mubihile kuhicha” Kuno veve wihicha? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Wilonga, “Mubihile ugoni” Kuno veve wigona. Ukuchivipila ming'omong'omo ga valungu kuno veve ugehe na umosi kwa kuhicha finu fya mukaye cha valungulu? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Wikwidumba kuva ugehe na malagilicho ga Nguluvi, sewilola ukumliga Nguluvi kwa kudenya malagilicho gyake? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga, “Vanu se Vayawudi vakaliliga litawa lya Nguluvi, kwakuva lya mawofu gyenu Vayawudi.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kudumula bina ndi kinu kinofu ngita wikolela malagilicho. Ila ngita sewikolela malagilicho wiwana na yula munu yesedumula bina. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Vala vanu se Vayawudi vala sevadumulwe bina, vikigita ngita malagilicho peing'ang'a, wuli, dasevalilwa ngita vevadumulwe bina? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Ndeni vala vanu se Vayawudi vala sevadumulwe muvili, ila vakukolela malagilicho, davakuvahiga nyenye Vayawudi, kwakuva semukolela malagilicho ata ngita mugehe na malagilicho geisimbilwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Suwe, sekila munu yeababilwe na Muyawudi daivecha munu va Nguluvi. Munu seiwesa kuvecha munu va Nguluvi kwakuva adumulwe bina kimvili. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ila munu va Nguluvi ndi yula yeakumudikila Nguluvi kwa numbula lyake yonda. Kudumulwa bina kwa undakyene igitwa na Muhe va Nguluvi munumbula se kukolela malagilicho gegisimbilwe. Munu ngita uyo idikilwa na Nguluvi yumwene na se vanu.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Suwe, wuli, Vayawudi vana kinu liki kyekihongilike kuchumba vanu se Vayawudi? Awu kudumula bina kugehe na fwaida liki? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ena, itanga hilo kwa ng'asi chongofu. Kwanja, Nguluvi akalamuwe kuvagavila Vayawudi unanzi vake. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ila daivecha wuli ngita vamonga vawo sevalidikile unanzi ulo? Wuli, luchowo ulo dalikumgita Nguluvi abihile kudikilwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Hamu! Nguluvi ilonga undakyene, ata kila munu ndi mudesi, ngita Masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">“Pewilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">njowo chako ndi cha undakyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">na pewihiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">lihigo lyako ivecha ngita peing'ang'wa.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ila ngita uwofu vetu uwonesa kuva Nguluvi igita tudikilwe pautalo lyake, datulonga liki? Wuli tulonge Nguluvi ikosela peatuhiga? Baha ndiywanga ngita munu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Hamu! Ngita ngaivecha ndeni, Nguluvi ngaiwesa wuli kuvahiga vanu vevagehe muinyi?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Ila munu iwesa kuucha, “Ngita udesi vangu utanga kuwonesa undakyene va Nguluvi na kuginicha ukomi vake, kwa liki nene ndihigwa kuva ndigehe na sambi?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Kuko iwana petulonga, “Tuveche tugita sambi neke gache manofu”. Vanu vangi vakutulata kwa udesi, kuva ata nefwe tuwulanicha ndeni. Avo vonda davahigwa kuwana na mawofu gyao.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwahela munu yeagehe msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Tulonge liki? Wuli nefwe Vayawudi ndi ngiba kuchumba vanu se Vayawudi? Hamu! Ndikawonesile suwe, Vayawudi awu vanu se Vayawudi vonda vana sambi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Kwahela ata munu yumwi yeagehe msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />kwahela munu yeakumchela Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">vala kwihela yeang'ang'a kumgumbanikila Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Vonda vamlekile Nguluvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">vonda vawofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">kwahela yeigita manofu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">kwahela ata yumwi.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Njowo chihofu chechihuma mumilomo gyao ngita manung'unilo njanganifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">navo vakuvachanga vanu figono fyonda na kuvagita vakogope.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">Njowo chawo chevalonga chikuvalemacha ngita sumu lya lyoka.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Munjowo chawo chevalonga chimemile kuvakotala vanu vangi na chechikuvalemacha vanu vangi.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Vanu avo vapefu kuvalemacha vanu na kuvadocha,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Vanu avo poponda pevahelala vakuhananga finu na kuvaleka vanu vagudike.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Sevachela kwikala kwa lutengamaso,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />sevakumginya ng'odo Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Nondee, tuchela kuva Malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa peilonga, ilonga na vanu vala yevang'ang'wa kulongochwa na Malangilo neke kila yumwi abihile kwitasa na vanu vonda va inyi vihigwa na Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Kwakuva kwahela munu yeyonda yeadikilwa kuva ndi msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho, kwakuva malagilicho ikutugita twichele sambi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kudikilwa na Nguluvi kwa kumdikila Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Ila nondee ng'asi lya Nguluvi yeikuvagita vanu vaveche vasanzi pautalo lyake igubutuliwe. Ng'asi iyi seigitwa kwa malagilicho. Ata figanulo fya malagilicho na fya vavichi va Nguluvi fihumulila lukani ulu. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nguluvi akuvagita vanu vonda kuva vasanzi pautalo lyake kwa kumdikila Yesu Kilisito. Nguluvi igita ndeni kwa vonda vevamdikila Kilisito. Kwakuva Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi vonda viwana. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Vanu vonda vagitile sambi na uwumi vawo sewiwonesa ukomi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Ila kwakuva Nguluvi msanzi hilo, akuvagita vanu vonda vidikilwe pautalo lyake kuchumbila Kilisito Yesu yeatukombowe. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nguluvi akamuhechile Yesu neke kwa danda lyake aveche ng'asi lya kuvahechela vanu sambi chawo kwa kumudikila Yesu Kilisito. Nguluvi akagitile ndeni kuwonesa kuva mwene ndi msanzi. Kwakuva dahila Nguluvi akali ngita seilola sambi chao. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Akagitile ndeni neke awonese usanzi vake muchipindi cha nondee kwa kuvagita vanu vaveche vasanzi pautalo lyake kwa kumdikila Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Suwe, tuwesa kwidumbila liki? Hamu! Wuli, kwakuva lya kukolela Malagilicho? Hamu! Ila kwa kumdikila Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Nguluvi akuvagita vanu vadikilwe pautalo lyake kwa kumdikila mwene hela. Sekwakuva lya kukolela Malagilicho. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Wuli, mwihocha kuva Nguluvi ndi Nguluvi va Vayawudi hela? Awu, wuli, mwene se Nguluvi va vanu se Vayawudi ndeni ndeni? Ndakyene, mwene ndi Nguluvi va Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi ndeni ndeni. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Nguluvi yumwi hela na kuvagita avo vevadumuwe bina vadikilwe pautalo lyake kwa kudikila, ndeni ndeni akuvagita avo se vadumuwe bina vadikilwe pautalo lyake kwa kudikila. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Wuli, tukugalambula malagilicho kwa ludikilo ulu? Hamu! Sendeni ila tukolela malagilicho.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Mufanu va Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Suwe, tulonge kinu liki kutigila daada vetu Ibulahimu? Akachele wuli munu peakudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ngita Ibulahimu akali adikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi kuhumila na magito gake, suwe, anakyo kinu kya kwidumbila ila se pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Masimbo ga Nguluvi gilonga, “Ibulahimu akamdikile Nguluvi, ndeni akadikilwe pautalo lyake.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Munu peigita kasi, seihombwa ngita fupo ila ihombwa kinu kyeing'ang'wa kuhombwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Ila munu yeseihuvila magito gamwene, ila akumdikila Nguluvi yeakuvahechela vanu sambi chawo, suwe, Nguluvi akuilolela ludikilo lwa munu uyo na kumgita msanzi pautalo lyake. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Dawudi akalongile njowo ichi ichi, pealongile ndi lukeduko kwa munu yula yeagitilwe na Nguluvi kuva msanzi ngajila kulolela magito gyawo,<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Vafunyilwe vala yevahechilwe nongwa chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">ambavo sambi chawo chihechilwe.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Vafunyilwe munu yula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">ambalye Nguluvi seiviwuka sambi chake!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Wuli, lufunyo ulu ndi kwa vala Vayawudi vevadumulwe bina hela awu ata kwa vala se Vayawudi sevadumulwe bina? Kwakuva tukalongile suwe, “Ibulahimu akamdikile Nguluvi na mwene akamgitile msanzi pautalo lyake.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Wuli, Ibulahimu akadikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi pandili? Peadumilwe bina awu peave kudumulwa bina? Akadikilwe kuva msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi ngajila kudumulwa bina. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ibulahimu akadumulwe bina pambele na kudumulwa bina kwa mwene ikali kimanyilo lya kuwonesa kuva Nguluvi amdikile kuva kwakuva lya ludikilo lwake ngajila seadumilwe bina. Ndeni Ibulahimu ndi daada kwa vala vonda ata ngita sevadumulwe ila vakamudikile Nguluvi navo vakadikilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ndeni ndeni, Ibulahimu ndi daada va vevadumulwe bina muludikilo, ikiva vakumudikila Nguluvi. Sevavecha daada vawo kwakuva vadumulwe bina, ila ndi daada vawo kwakuva vamudikile Nguluvi ngita peagitile mwene, pala peave kudumulwa bina.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwa ludikilo vanu uwanuka kyealongile Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Nguluvi akavikile jangi kwa Ibulahimu na ulelo vake, kuva inyi yonda daivecha lyake, sekwakuva Ibulahimu akagitile ngita malagilicho peing'ang'a, ila kwakuva amudikile Nguluvi na Nguluvi akamudikile kuva msanzi pautalo lyake. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Kwakuva ngita gala geajangile Nguluvi davapata vala hela yevakolele malagilicho, suwe, kumudikila Nguluvi se kinu na gala geajangile Nguluvi dasevecha kinu. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Malagilicho ga Nguluvi ileta luvipo kwa Nguluvi ila ngita kwihela malagilicho, daiwesekana kudenya malagilicho.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Kwa ndeni, ijangi ilyo ihuvilila ludikilo, ndeni ujangi lulo ihumila na usangi va Nguluvi na ndakyene kuva ijangi lulo ndi kwa vanu vonda, ila se kwa vala vevikwikala kwa kukolela malagilicho, ila ndeni kwa vala vevakwikala kwa ludikilo ngita Ibulahimu. Mwene ndi daada vetu vonda, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga, “Ndikuhaguwe uveche daada va vanu va inyi chongofu.” Mwene ndi daada vetu pautalo lya Nguluvi yeamdikiye. Nguluvi yeakuvagavila uwumi vanu vevafuwe na kwa malagilicho gyake finu fyefikali kwihela, dafigehe. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibulahimu pealongilwe njowo icho, ikali ikagangafu kuchidikila, ila akaendelela kudikila na kuhuvilila, kuva Nguluvi dakumgita aveche daada va vanu va inyi chongofu, kwakuva Nguluvi akali amulongile Ibulahimu, “Dauvecha na vilelo volofu ngita nondwa!” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Chipindi icho Ibulahimu akali mgogolo va myaka gyake ikali ngita miya yimwi, akali ichela kuva mvili vake ukali ngita ufuwe, ndeni ata mdala vake Sala akali mugumba. Ila Ibulahimu seakalikile kumudikila Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ibulahimu akali ihela uwogofi na yila jangi lya Nguluvi, akaendelela kuvecha na ludali muludikilo lwake, ndeni akamnjumile Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ibulahimu akachele kwa undakyene kuva Nguluvi iwesa kugagita gala gyeajangile. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ndeni Ibulahimu kwa kumdikila Nguluvi, “Nguluvi akamudikile kuva Ibulahimu ndi msanzi pautalo lyake.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Njowo ichi, “Akagitilwe kuva msanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi.” Sechisimbilwe kwa Ibulahimu hela, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />ila pamwi na nefwe twetumudikile Nguluvi yeamchulubuche Mtwa vetu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Yesu akahecheliwe adochwe kwakuva lya sambi chetu, baho akachulubuchwe neke tudikilwe kuva vasanzi pautalo lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Makani gegileta kudikilwa na Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Nondee, tudikilwe na Nguluvi kwa kudikila, suwe, tukwikala kwa lutengmaso na Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kwa ng'asi lya kumdikila Yesu, Nguluvi atugavile usanzi vake, ata nondee twihendelela kwikala muusanzi ugo. Suwe, tuhekelela hilo kwakuva tukuhuvilila datukwingila pamwi na Nguluvi muukomi vake. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ndakyene, se ago hela, ndeni ndeni tuhekelela mumagudo tukichela kuva magudo gitutanga tuveche vachindila, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />na luchindilo luletela tubihile kuwogopa na kubihila kogopa ikutuletela luhuvililo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Luhuvililo ulo, seliwesa kutugavila nyoni, kwakuva Nguluvi katusukulila suwe lukelo lwake munumbula chetu kwa ng'asi lya Muhe va Nguluvi yetugavilwe nefwe.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Petukali setuwesa kwilowa vavene musambi, chipindi pechitimiye, Kilisito akafuwe kwakuva lya nefwe vawofu. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Seupefu kwa munu kufuwa kwakuva lya munu yeadikilwe pautalo lwa Nguluvi, ila munu iwesa kufuwa kwakuva lya munu mnofu. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Ila Nguluvi awonesile kuva akutukela, kwakuva petukali musambi, akamuhechile Kilisito afuwe kwakuva lya nefwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Kwakuva nondee tudikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa danda lya Kilisito, ndi ndakyene kuva daatulowa muluvipo lwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Kwakuva petuwave vachundama va Nguluvi, tukanjengilwe kaya kuchumbila kufuwa kwa Mwana vake. Na ngita tunjengilwe kaya na Nguluvi, suwe, tuchela datulowoliwa kwa uwumi va Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ila se aga hela, ila ndeni ndeni tuhekelela kwa gala geagitile Nguluvi kwa ng'asi lya Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito, yeatunjengile kaya na Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Sambi ikahingile muinyi kuchumbila munu yumwi na sambi ilyo ikaletela tufuwe. Ndeni kufuwa kukalutala kwa vanu vonda, kwakuva vonda vagitile sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Sambi ikavechile muinyi kabula lya malagilicho ga Nguluvi geagavile Musa, ila Nguluvi seakavalongile vanu kuva vana sambi. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ila kuhuma chipindi cha Adamu mbaka chipindi cha Musa, kufuwa kukalutala kwa vanu vonda, ata ngita vala sevagitile sambi ngita yeagitile Adamu kuleka gala gyealagilichwe na Nguluvi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu akali awananiswe na Kilisito, ngaachile pambele. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Ila sambi lya Adamu seiwana na usangi va Nguluvi. Sambi lya munu yumwi Adamu yeagitile vanu vonda vafuwe kwakuva lya sambi lyake. Ila kugehe na yumwi yungi uyo ndi Yesu Kilisito, yeakuvagavila vanu volofu fupo lya usanzi lwa Nguluvi, unanzi ugo va Nguluvi ndi ukomi hilo kuchumba sambi lya Adamu. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kangi Nguluvi peakuvahechelela vanu sambi kwa ng'asi lya unanzi vake seiwana na gala gegiletwa na sambi lya Adamu. Sambi yila yimwi lya Adamu peigitilwe na vanu, Nguluvi akavahigile nongwa vanu vonda. Ila nondee sambi chongofu chigitilwe, ila Nguluvi ave akuvadikila vanu avo kwa ng'asi lya usanzi vake. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ndakyene kwa sambi lya munu yumwi, kufuwa kukavangile kukalutala kuchumbila munu uyo yumwi. Ila kila keagitile munu yumwi uyo Yesu Kilisito ndi lukani lukomi hilo. Vanu vonda veviwanuka usanzi ugo ambavo ndi fupo lwa kudikilwa pauatlo lya Nguluvi, davatavala muwumi kwa ng'asi lya Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Suwe, Nguluvi akuvahiga vanu kwakuva lya nongwa limwi lwagitilwe na Adamu. Ila lugito limwi lwegitile Kilisito likavavikile kuvecha vanu vaveche pekesu, ndeni Nguluvi akuvadikila vanu kwa ng'asi lya gito limwi lyeagitile Kilisito. Ndeni vanu viwanuka uwumi va mbepali kuhuma kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Kwakuva ngita munu yumwi seakamdikile Nguluvi na vanu volofu vakaingile musambi, ila vanu volofu vakadikilwe pautalo lwa Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Ila peyachile malagilicho neke kuvawonesa vanu kuva vagitile sambi, ila vanu pevaginile kugita sambi Nguluvi akaginile kuhongelecha usanzi vake kwa vanu vake. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Ngita fila sambi peilutale na kuletela kufuwa, ndeni ndeni usanzi va Nguluvi ulutile na kuletela uwumi va mbepali kwa ng'asi lya Yesu Kilisito Mtwa vetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Tufuwe musambi ila tukwikala mu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Tulonge liki? Wuli, tuyendelele kugita sambi usanzi va Nguluvi uhongeleke? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Hamu! Yila ludobokelo lwa kugita sambi mugati lyetu ifuwe, datuendelela wuli kugita sambi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Wuli, semuchela kuva petubatiswe tukawungile na Kilisito Yesu? Nefwe tukawunganile mukufuwa chake. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Petubatiswe tukasilwe pamwi na mwene na kwiwungana mukufuwa kwa mwene, neke ngita fila Kilisito peachulubuchwe kwa ukomi va Daada, ndeni ndeni nefwe tuwese kwikala muwumi umiya.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kwakuva ngita nefwe twiwungile na mwene mufuwa, ndeni ndeni datuwunga na mwene muuchulubuko vake. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Twichela kuva unu vetu va dahila ivambilwe pakipindilihicho pamwi na Kilisito, neke ludali lwa sambi yeigehe mumvili gyetu gianangwe, tubihile kugita sambi kangi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Kwakuva, munu yeyonda peifuwa, avikilwe pekesu patali na sambi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Suwe, ikiva tufuwe pamwi na Kilisito, twihuvilila kuva datukwikala pamwi na mwene. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Kwakuva, twichela kuva Kilisito achulubuchwe suwe na seifuwa kangi, kwihela ludali chechikumgita afuwe kangi. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Suwe, kwakuva akafuwe mala yimwi hela, sambi ihela ludali kangi kwa mwene na akwikala pamwi na Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Ndeni ndeni, nyenye mwing'ang'wa kuchela mufuwe musambi, ila nondee mwihoche ngita yemukwikala pamwi na Nguluvi kuchumbila Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Ndeni, muleke kugita sambi kangi vala mubihile kuchileka mivili gyenu gegifuwa kugita sambi na kangi mubihile kuchidikila ludobokelo njanganifu chake. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Vala mubihile kuhecha ata pono yimwi lya muvili vako kiveche kyombo kya kugitila uwofu na sambi. Ila muyiheche kwa Nguluvi, ngita vanu yevachulubuchwe, hechile pono lya mvili vako kwa Nguluvi neke chigundamike kwa kugita kasi yeing'ang'a Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Sambi sedaivecha na umwimike kangi kwa nyenye, kwakuva semwilongochwa na malagilicho, ila mwilongochwa na usanzi va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasi lyetu kugita usanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Suwe, tulonge liki? Wuli, tugite sambi kwakuva setulongochwa na malagilicho? Ila tulongochwa na usanzi va Nguluvi? Hamu! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ndakyene, nyenye mwichela kuva pemwikwitanga mwavene ngita vasutu na kumpulikicha tunga. Nyenye muvecha vasutu kwa uyo yemukumpulikicha. Pemuyihecha kuvecha vasutu va sambi damwisilila kufuwa, ila pemuvecha vasutu kwa kumdikila Nguluvi damudikilwa pautalo lyake. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Ata dahila mukali vasutu va sambi, ila nondee ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi, kwakuva nondee mudikile kwa numbula chenu chonda mawulanicho gemugavilwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva avagavile upekesu neke mubihile kugita sambi. Avagitile ngita vasutu vake neke muwese kugita makani gegikumkelesa mwene. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Baha ndilonga ng'ombelo ngita vanu pevaywanga, kwakuva lya usosovafu venu. Ngita fila dahila pemudikile kulongochwa na makani manjanganifu na mawofu, ila nondee mwing'ang'wa muyiheche mwavene kugagita geasaka Nguluvi, neke muveche vachulila vake.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Pemukali vasutu va sambi mukali semugita gala geasaka Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Wuli, mukapatile liki figono fila peamugitile ago, nondee mukugawonela nyoni? Kwakuva, gala gemugitile gikuvaletela kufuwa! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Ila nondee mukomboliwe musambi na muvechile vachulila va Nguluvi. Kyemupatila nondee ndi kukala patali na sambi, mahumilo gake ndi kung'alichwa na kuwanuka uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Kwakuva mahombo ga sambi ndi kufuwa, ila fupo lwa Nguluvi ndi uwumi va mbepali kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu, Mtwa vetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Mufanu va kwitola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Vakolo vangu, nyenye vonda muchela ndakyene aga gendilonga, kwakuva ndilonga na vanu vevichela malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa. Malagilicho ikumlongocha munu peave ikwikala. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Kwa mufanu, mdala yeatolilwe adindilwe na malagilicho chipindi chonda mgosi vake peave akwikala, ila mgosi vake peafuwa, mdala uyo seadindilwa kangi na malagilicho. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Ndeni, mdala uyo atawike na mgosi yungi chipindi mgosi vake agehe wumi, daikemelwa mgoni. Ila mgosi peifuwa, mdala uyo sedaidindwa kangi na malagilicho na peitolwa na mgosi yungi, mwene semgoni. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Ndeni ndeni, vakolo vangu, ifi nde igehe kwa nyenye semulongochwa kangi na malagilicho, kwakuva mufuwe pamwi na Kilisito. Nondee muvechile vake mwene yeachulubuchwe neke muwese kumgitila Nguluvi makani manofu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Kwakuva dahila tukalongochwe fila mvili peung'ang'a, luboko cha sambi chechiyovelechwa na malagilicho chikagitile kasi mumvili gyetu, makani gyonda getugitile gatuletela kufuwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Ila nondee setulongochwa na malagilicho. Tukafuwe mulukani lwetugitile tuveche ngita vasutu. Ila nondee tukwikala kwa kulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi na sekwa ng'asi lya dahila lya malagilicho gegisimbilwe.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilicho na sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Wuli, tulonge liki? Kuva malagilicho ndi sambi? Hamu! Ila ngajila Malagilicho, nene sengachele ludobokelo njanganifu ndi kinu liki. Ngita malagilicho sengailongile, “Ubihile kudobokela kinu kya munu yungi.” Nondee ndichela kuva kudoboka ndi kinu kinjanganifu. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Kwa malagilicho ago, sambi ikapatile nafwasi lya kuyovelecha ludoboko njanganifu chongofu mumvili vangu. Ila ngajila malagilicho sambi ndi kinu kyekifuwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Pamwandi pendikali wumi, kangi ndigita kyendikela, ila malagilicho peyachile, ikanigitile ndichele kuva ndigehe na sambi na nene ndikali ngita ndifuwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Ndeni, malagilicho ago geing'ang'ile kuniletela uwumi, ila ikaniletile kufuwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Kwa ng'asi lya malagilicho ago, sambi ikanichangile na kuniletela kufuwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Suwe, malagilicho aga gihuma kwa Nguluvi na amuli gihuma kwa Nguluvi na ndinofu na chigehe ngita peching'ang'a. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ndakyene, kinu kinofu sedakiwesa, kunigita ndifuwe! Sambi nde ikanigitila ndifuwe kwa kuchumbila, kuchumbila malagilicho. Nguluvi akasakile kuva malagilicho chiveche chiwonesa kuva sambi ndi kinu kinjanganifu hilo.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludali lwa sambi muwumi vetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tuchela kuva malagilicho gihuma kwa Nguluvi, ila nene ninago umunu va sambi, kuno kulonga kuva nene ndimsutu va sambi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Sendichela kyenigita, kwakuva kila kyendikela sendikigita, ila ndigita kila kyendikivipila. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ndikiva ndigita kila kyendikivipila, iyi ndidikila kuva malagilicho ndi manofu. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Undakyene, senene yendigita mawofu, ila sambi yeikala mugati lyangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ndichela kuva kwihela kinu kinofu muumunu vangu. Kwakuva ndikela kugita kinu kinofu, ila sendiwesa. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Kwakuva lila linofu lyendikela kuligita, sendikuligita, ila ndigita lila liwofu lyesendilikela kuligita. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ndeni, ndikiva ndigita gala gyesendikela kugita, ndakyene senene yendikugagita ago, ila sambi yeigita mugati lyangu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Suwe, ndiyiwulaniche kinu iki, pendikela kugita kinu kinofu, mawofu nago gagehe baho. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Kwakuva ndikedukila malagilicho ga Nguluvi kuhumila na umunu vangu umiya va mugati. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Ila ndilola kuva kugehe na malagilicho gangi geigita kasi mumvili vangu, malagilicho gegipinjana na gala malagilicho geidikilwa na luhala lwangu. Ndeni, daikunigita ndiveche msutu va sambi yeigita kasi mumvili vangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Sungandilola nene! Ndi ani dakundilowa nene kuhuma mvili ugu weukunigita nene ndifuwe? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi kwakuva mwene daindilowa kuchumbila Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Ndeni, nene mwene kwa luhala lwangu ndigitila kasi malagilicho ga Nguluvi, ila chipindi chingi nene ndigitila kasi malagilicho ga sambi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Uwumi mu Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Ndeni, nondee kwihela lihigo kwa vala vanu vevawungine na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Kwakuva, malagilicho lwa Muhe yeiletela uwumi kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu, inivikile pekesu mululagilicho lwa sambi na kufuwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Kwakuva, Nguluvi akagitile lukani lula, ambalyo malagilicho seliwesile kuligita, kwakuva lya usosovafu va vanu. Nguluvi akamlagiliche Mwana vake akiva na mvili wiuwana na mvili vetu nefwe vene sambi, neke aihige sambi na kwa mvili ugo akaihanangile sambi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nguluvi akagitile ndeni neke tuwese kwikala ngita malagilicho peikela, ila nondee tuwesa kwikala ndeni kwa kulongochwa na ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi na sekwa kukovekela ludali lwa mvili va munu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Kwakuva, vanu vevakwikala kwa kukovekela mvili pewisaka, avo mahocho gyawo gilongochwa kwa gala gegisaka mvili. Ila vala vevakwikala kwa kukovekela Muhe va Nguluvi pewisaka, avo mahocho gyawo gilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Vanu vevilongochwa na mahocho ga mvili giletela kufuwa, ila vanu vevilongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi giletela uwumi na lutengamaso. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Kwakuva, munu yealongochwa na mahocho ga mvili ndi mchundwama va Nguluvi, seadikila malagilicho ga Nguluvi na kwa undakyene seivesa kudikila. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Vanu vevadikila gala mvili gewisaka, sevawesa kumkelesa Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Ila nyenye ngita Muhe va Nguluvi akikala mugati lyenu dasemudikila gala mvili gewisaka, ila damudikila Muhe va Nguluvi, ngita munu yeyonda seyeivecha na Muhe va Kilisito, uyo seva Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Nondee, Kilisito akwikala mugati lyenu. Ata ngita mivili gyenu gifuwa kwakuva lya sambi, suwe, Muhe va Nguluvi akuvagavila uwumi kwakuva Nguluvi avagitile mudikilwe pautalo lyake. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ikiva Muhe va Nguluvi yeamchulubuche Kilisito akwikala mugati lyenu, suwe uyo yeamchulubuche Kilisito na mwene daakuigavila uwumi mivili gyenu gegifuwa. Daigita ndeni kuchumbila Muhe vake yeikwikala mugati lyenu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Suwe, vakolo vangu, nefwe setwing'ang'a kangi kwikala kwa kulongochwa na ludoboko cha mivili gyetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Kwakuva, mukikala ngita mvili peing'ang'a, ndakyene damfuwa. Ila ngita mukikala kwa kulongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi, damuvecha wumi. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Kwakuva vonda vevalongochwa na Muhe va Nguluvi ndi vana va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Kwakuva, Muhe yemugavilwe na Nguluvi seivakuvagita nyenye muveche vasutu na kuvagita muwogofye, ila Muhe va Nguluvi akuvagita muveche vana va Nguluvi na kwa umwimike va Muhe uyo nefwe tukumkemela, “Aba!” Mana lyake Daada! <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Muhe va Nguluvi yumwene ilonga ndakyene pamwi na muhe chetu kuva nefwe ndi vana va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Kwakuva, nefwe ndi vana vake, ndeni nefwe datuwanuka finu finofu kwa Nguluvi, datuwanuka pamwi na Kilisito, ngita petugudile pamwi na mwene, ndeni ndeni datukwikala na mwene muukomi vake.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluvi avavikile vanu vake makani makomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Kwakuva, magudo gyendigudika nondee sekinu na segiwana na gala Nguluvi geatuvikile, ambago datugubututuliwa kwa nefwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Finu fyonda fyefiwumbilwe, fichindila kwa ludoboko ngoni, pala Nguluvi daakuvawonesa wachi vana vake. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Kwakuva, kila kinu kyekiwumbilwe na Nguluvi akakilekile kiveche na mapungufu gake, finu ifyo sefisakile fyene kuvecha ndeni, ila Nguluvi akalekile gahumile ago kwakuva lya luhuvililo lya kukomboliwa neke fibihile kuhanangilwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Kangi finu ifyo fyefiwumbilwe fichindila kigono kya kwiwunga pamwi na vana va Nguluvi muupekesu ukomi va kuhuma mukufuwa na kuhanangilwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Kwakuva, tuchela kuva mbaka nondee, finu fyonda fyefiwumbilwe fing'ung'ulika kwa matuno ngita uvafi lwa kubaba mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Sefiwumbe hela, ila ata nefwe yetugehe na Muhe va Nguluvi, yeagehe va kwanja mufupo cha Nguluvi, nefwe ndeni ndeni twing'ung'ula kwa mugati, kuno tuchindilila kugitwa kuvecha vana va Nguluvi na kukombolwa na kugalambula mivili gyetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Kwakuva, tukombilwe muluhuvililo ulu. Ila ngita datulola luhuvililo ulo, baho kwihela luhuvililo. Wuli, yeani yeihuvilila kinu kyekiwene? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Ngita tuhuvilila kila kinu setukilola, suwe tukihuvilila kwa luchindilo.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ndeni ndeni, Muhe va Nguluvi akututanga muusosovafu vetu. Kwakuva setuchela kumsuka Nguluvi ngita peing'ang'wa. Ila Muhe va Nguluvi yumwene akutusukila kwa Nguluvi kwa kung'ung'ula seiwesa kulongeka. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Na mwene Nguluvi yealola mbaka mugati lya numbula cha vanu, ichela Muhe vake kyekihocha, kwakuva Muhe akuvasukila vanu va Nguluvi ngita peikela Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Twichela kuva, mufinu fyonda, Nguluvi igita gyonda gaveche manofu kwa vanu vala yevakumkela na vala vevakemilwe, ngita mwene peakeliye. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Kwakuva, vanu vale Nguluvi akavachele kuhuma dahila, akavahagule vawane na Mwana vake, neke Mwana uyo aveche mwana mlongola va vana va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ndeni, vala yevahaguliwe na Nguluvi, akavakemeliye na vala yevavakemele akavagitile vadikilwe pautalo lyake na vala yeavadikilwe pautalo lyake akakala navo pamwi muukomi vake.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukelo lwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Munjowo ichi, nondee tulonge liki? Ikiva Nguluvi agehe lubali lwetu, ani yeiwesa kutupinja? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nguluvi seamuwonela lusungu ata Mwana vake vaweka, ila akamuhechile Mwana vake neke afuwe kwakuva lya nefwe vonda, suwe, ndakyene datugavila kangi finu finofu fyonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ndi ani, yeakuvalata vanu vevahaguliwe na Nguluvi? Nguluvi yumwene alongile kuva vahela nongwa! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Ndi ani daakuvahiga nongwa? Kwahela! Kwakuva Kilisito Yesu akachulubuke kwakuva lya nefwe na akwikala lubali lwa ndewo lwa Nguluvi, akutusukila kwa Nguluvi! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Ani yeawesa kutunenga na lukelo lwa Kilisito? Wuli, magudo, utumama, utatala, njala, ufula, fita awu kufuwa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">“Kwakuva lyako, vanu vigecha kutudocha pamiye na pamunyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">vakutulola ngita kondolo vevihinjwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Ila munjowo chonda nefwe tuwesile, kuchumbila mwene yeatukela. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Kwakuva, kwa ndakyene ndichela, kwihela kinu kyekiwesa kutunenga na lukelo vake, sekufuwa vala uwumi, sevandumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi awu mihoka gegigehe na ludali, vala semakani gigituhumila nondee vala semakani gegikwacha, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />vala makani ga inyi gegagehe kukyanya vala makani ga inyi gegagehe panyi, vala kiweumbe kyokyonda, kyekiwesa kutunenga na lukelo lwa Nguluvi lweugehe mugati lwa Kilisito Yesu, Mtwa vetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Nguluvi na vanu vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ndilonga undakyene nene ndi munu va Kilisito, sendilonga udesi. Umwimike va kuhagula manofu na manjanganifu ikwidikila na Muhe va Nguluvi, kuva nene sendichanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Ndakyene nene ndigehe na matuno hilo, matuno segegisila munumbula lwangu, <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />kwakuva lya vanu va inyi lyangu. Ndikidikila kukotoliwa na kunengwa na Kilisito, neke ndivagite vakolo vangu Vayawudi vamudikile Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Avo ndi vanu va Isilaeli, yevahaguliwe na Nguluvi vaveche vana vake, yevawonisile ukomi vake, yeagitile lulagano navo na yeavagavile malagilicho gake, yeavawonisile ng'asi lya kumgundamikila mwene na jangi chake. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Vene ndi vababwa va daada vetu vakomi na Kilisito yeababilwe kimunu, kuhuma mulukolo lwao. Nguluvi yeatavala mufinu fyonda, anjumwe mbepali! Ndakyene.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Sendilonga kuva Nguluvi akanile kugita kila kyeajangile, kwakuva se vanu vonda Vaisilaeli ndi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Ndeni ndeni, sevababwa vonda va Ibulahimu ndi vana vake Nguluvi, kwakuva Nguluvi akamlongiye Ibulahimu, “Vababwa vako dafahuma kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ndeni, sevala vevababilwe kimvili ndi vana va Nguluvi, ila vala vevababilwe kuhumila na jangi lya Nguluvi nde davakemelwa vana va Ibulahimu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Kwakuva, Nguluvi akajangile ndeni, “Chipindi chene dandiwuya na Sala daibaba mwana mkigosi.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Kangi seago hela, ila Lebeka akababile na mgogolo vetu Isaka mambila. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Neke Nguluvi awoneke ihagula kyeasaka, ata peave sevababilwe na peave kugita manofu na manjanganifu. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Nguluvi akamlongile Lebeka, “Mwana mkomi daakumgumbanikila mnung'uwe.” Lukani lulo liwonesa kuva Nguluvi akumkemela munu ngita peakela mwene na sekulolela makani gake geagita munu uyo. <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga, “Nguluvi akamkeliye hilo Yakobo kuchumba Esau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Suwe, tulonge liki? Wuli, Nguluvi ibagula vanu? Hamu, seibagula! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Kwakuva Nguluvi akamlongiye Musa, “Dandikumgitila usanzi vangu munu yendikela kumgitila usanzi, dandikumuwonela lusungu munu yendikela kumuwonela lusungu.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ndeni makani gyonda ihuvilila lusungu lwa Nguluvi sekyeakela munu awu kila munu kyeagita. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Kwakuva masimbo ga Nguluvi gikumlongela ndeni ng'chale Falao va Misili, “Ndikagugitile uveche ng'achele neke ndiwese kuwonesa umwimike vangu na litawa lyangu lichelwe muinyi yonda.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Suwe, Nguluvi akumuwonela lusungu munu yeyonda yeisaka kumuwonela lusungu na peikela kumgita munu aveche msugu, igita ndeni.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luvipo na lusungu lwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ila yumwi pagati lyenu iwesa kunihucha, “Kwa liki Nguluvi ave akutulawumu? Ani yeawesa kugapinja gala geakela Nguluvi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Ila veve ani yewiwesa kumuhucha Nguluvi? Wuli, kiwiya kiwesa kumuhucha yeagelaniche, “Kwa liki unigalaniche ndeni?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mgelanicha fiviya iwesa kugelanicha fiwiya fivili kwa mganga wumwi ngita peikela, kimwi kuvikila finofu na kingi kuvikila uhafu.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ndeni vanu vangi ndigita fiviya fyefing'ang'wa kuhanangilwa na Nguluvi, ndeni Nguluvi akuvavipila. Ila Nguluvi akasakile kuwonesa umwimike vake. Ila akavachindile na kuvahuvilila vala vanu vevang'ang'ilwe kuhanangwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Yumwene akasakile kuwonesa wachi ukomi vake, peatugavile nefwe yetugehe natilo lya lusungu lwake, akatuhagule kuhuma dahila tuwanuke ukomi vake. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ndeni nefwe nde vanu yeatukemeleliye, sekuhuma kwa Vayawudi hela, ila ndeni ndeni kuhuma kwa vanu se Vayawudi. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Ngita Nguluvi pealongile mukiganulo kya Hoseya mvichi vake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Vala vevakali, ‘Sevanu vangu’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Dandikuvakemela, ‘Vanu vangu!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Na vanu sedavakeliye, dandikuvakemela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">‘Vanu dandikuvakela.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Na pala pevalongilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Nyenye sevangu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">baho davakemelwa, ‘Vana va Nguluvi yeagehe wumi.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ndeni ndeni mvichi va Nguluvi Isaya, akuvalandulicha kwa lichwi likomi, “Ata ngita vanu va Isilaeli vagehe volofu ngita muhanga va mung'umbung'umbu lya inyanza, ndi vadodo hela davakomboliwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Kwakuva, Mtwa sedaichelewa kuvahiga vanu va inyi yonda.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Ngita pealongwile kulonga mvichi va Nguluvi Isaya, “Mtwa munya ludali, sengatulekile ulelo va Isilaeli, vonda ngatufuwe ngita vanu va Sodoma na Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvasukila vanu va Isilaeli kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Suwe, tulonge liki? Vanu se Vayawudi sevagitile kinu kyokyonda neke vadikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi, ila vakadikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kudikila kwavo, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />ila Vaisilaeli vakasakile kudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho ga Nguluvi geamgavile Musa. Ila sevapatile malagilicho gakuvagita vadikilwe pautalo lyake. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Kwa liki sevadikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi? Kwakuva vakahuvilile magito gyawo na sekumdikila Kilisito. Baho, vakayigumbadula, “Muliganga likuvagita vanu vaguwe.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">“Lole, danivika liganga ukoya Sayuni, liganga dalikuvagita vanu vakwigumbadula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">liganga dalikuvagita vanu vaguwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">Ila munu yeyonda daakumdikila Kilisito, sedailola nyoni.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Vakolo vangu, numbula lyangu idobokela hilo na ndikumsuka Nguluvi kuva Vaisilaeli vayangu, vakomboliwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Nene ndilonga ndakyene, vene vayihechile hilo kumdikila Nguluvi, ila se vichela unofu. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Kwakuva sevamchele Nguluvi peakuvagita vanu vaveche vasanzi pautalo lyake, ila vene vakagitile pevihocha na ndeni vakakanile kudikila fila Nguluvi peakuvagita vanu vaveche vasanzi pautalo lyake. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Kwakuva Kilisito akakamilise makani gala lagilicho pelisaka neke kila yumwi yeakumuidikila aidikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukombosi kwa vanu vonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Munjowo cha kudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kukolela malagilicho, Musa akasimbile ndeni, “Munu yeyonda daikolela malagilicho dakwikala kuchumbila malagilicho ago.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Munjowo cha kuidikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi kwa kudikila, masimbo gilonga ndeni, “Ubihile kulonga ani daakang'ala paluhano kwa Nguluvi amkwise panyi Kilisito ache kutukombola?” <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Vala mubihile kwihucha, “Ani daihelela panyi pono pa vanu vevafuwe amchulubuche Kilisito ache kutukombola?” <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Ila masimbo ga Nguluvi gilonga ndeni, “Unanzi ulu lwa Nguluvi ugehe pepi na veve, ugehe pamulomo na munumbula vako.” Ugu nde unanzi va ludikilo lwetukuvadalikila vanu. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ngita uhongecha kwa mulomo vako yumwene kuva Yesu ndi Mtwa na kudikila munumbula lwako kuva Nguluvi amuchulubuche kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe, dailowelwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Kwakuva munu kwa kuidikila munumbula na akudikilwa pautalo lya Nguluvi na kwa mulomo munu ihongecha na kulowolwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Masimbo ga Nguluvi gilonga, “Kila yeakumdikila Kilisito dasepatila nyoni.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Lukani ulu nde kwa vonda, kwakuva Nguluvi seakuvabagula Vayawudi na vanu se Vayawudi, kwakuva Nguluvi ndi Mtwa va vanu vonda na msanzi kwa vanu vonda vevakumsuka lutango. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ngita fila masimbo ga Nguluivi galonga, “Kila munu daisuka kwa litawa lya Mtwa, dailowelwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Nondee davakumsuka wuli, yula sevakumdikila? Baho davakumdikila wuli, yula sevakumpulika Njowo chake? Na davapulika wuli, ngita kwihela munu va kuvadalikila? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Na vanu davadalika wuli, ngita sevalagilichwe? Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga, “Lolele peiveche unofu kwacha kwa vanu kuvadalikila Njowo Chinofu!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Ila sevonda vevawanuka Njowo Chinofu, ngita Isaya mvichi va Nguluvi pealongile, “Mtwa, ndi ani yeadikile unanzi vetu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kwihela yeivecha na ludikilo peseipulika luchowo lya Njowo Nofu cha Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ila ndihucha, wuli, Vaisilaeli sevapulike ugo unanzi? Kwa ndakyene, kupulika vakapulikile, ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">Vanu vakapulike Lichwi pa inyi chonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">Vanu vakapulike unanzi muinyi chonda.<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Ndihucha kangi, wuli, Vaisilaeli sevachelege? Nguluvi akalonguwe kulonga kuchumbila Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">“Dandikuvagita vanu se Vaisilaeli Nguluvi daakuvakang'icha neke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">vavawonele wifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">dandikuvagita vanu se Vaisilaeli na luvipo, kwa vanu va inyi lya vapufi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Kangi Isaya mvichi va Nguluvi akalongile ngajila kuwogofiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">“Vanu vala sevakanisakile, vakaniwonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">ndikayihumiche kwa vanu sevahuchile njowo changu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ila kwa vanu va Isilaeli Nguluvi ilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">“Pamunyi ponda ndikasakile vaniwuyile ila nde vanu sevaidikila na nde va vasugu.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Nguluvi akuvawonela lsungu vanu va Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Suwe, ndikuvahucha, wuli, Nguluvi akuvakana Vayawudi vanu vake? Hamu seavakanile! Ndimwene ndi Mwisilaeli, mlelo va Ibulahimu ndihumila mug'ombelo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nguluvi seakavakanile vanu vake yeavahaguwe kuhuma dahila. Muwiwuka masimbo ga Nguluvi gyegikumuhumilila Elia mvichi va Nguluvi peakamsukile Nguluvi kwakuva lya sambi lya vanu va Isilaeli, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />akalongile “Mtwa, vanu vavadochile vavichi vako na kutunyula fitandangavala fyako fya maganga fya kuhechela usembe. Nene hela ndendisigaliye na visaka kunidocha!” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Wuli, Nguluvi akamuhigile liki? Akamuhigile, “Ndave ndigehe na vanu elufu saba yesevamgundamikiye mlungulu yeikemelwa Baali.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Suwe, ndeni mbaka nondee, vagehe Vaisilaeli vadodo yevahaguliwe kwa usanzi va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Vanu avo vahaguliwe kwa usanzi vake na sekwakuva lya magito gyawo. Kwakuva ngita Nguluvi akuvahagula vanu kwa kila kyevagita, usanzi vake ngaivecha sekinu.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Nonde wuli? Vanu va Isilaeli vapatile kila kyevakali vakisakile, Hamu sevakipatile! Ila vala yevahaguliwe na Nguluvi vakakipatile. Vanu vangi vakali vasugu. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ngita Masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga, “Nguluvi akagitile numbula chawo giveche misugu, akavagavile meho sevawesa kulola, akavagavile masigicha ila sevapulika mbaka neng'uli.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ngita Dawudi peilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">“Vakati vigita Lihungu lyao lya kuliya Nguluvi achibadilise chiveche kyamvi na mtambu va kuvagomecha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">na kuvatova.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Mewo gyawo gavikwe kisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">neke vabihile kulola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">Mimbele gyawo dagigugumbale kwa magudo mbepali!”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Suwe, ndihucha kangi, wuli Vayawudi pevakumbadule na kuguwa sevanamuke kangi? Hamu vakanamuke! Kwakuva kwa sambi chawo ulowa ukaachile kwa vanu se Vayawudi, neke Vayawudi avawonele wifu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Sambi cha Vayawudi chikaletile lufunyo longofu kwa vanu se vayawudva na kupwemuka kwa ludikilo lwao lwaletile lufunyo longofu kwa vanu se Vayawudi. Ndeni ngita Vayawudi nga vamuliye Nguluvi kwa kumuidkila Mlowa suwe dakuvecha na lufunyo hilo.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulowolwa kwa vanu se Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Suwe, nondee ndilonga na vanu nyenye se Vayawudi, kwakuva nene ndi mnjagila kwa vanu se Vayawudi, ndikwidumbila ngumbanikilo lyangu. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ndihocha ndiwese kuvagita Vayawudi vayangu vawone wifu, neke ndiwese kuvakombola vamonga vawo. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Kwakuva ngita Vayawudi pevakamkanile Yesu, nave Nguluvi akavakanile akachenga kaya na vanu se Vayawudi, daivecha wuli Nguluvi pe akuvaidikila Vayawudi kangi? Vanu vevafuwe davachulubuchwa!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Ngita kipandi kya kwanja kya libumunda kihechilwe kwa Nguluvi, libumunda londa lihechilwe kwa Nguluvi. Na ngita midadikwa gya mibiki gihechiliwe kwa Nguluvi na ndeni ndeni mikwati gyake gihechiliwe kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ila mikwati gangi ga miseituni ga mumgunda mdodo gigadumulwe na pala pono peidumulwe pakamatilwe likwati lwa miseituni ga kudasi. Nyenye vanu se Vayawudi muwana na mikwati gya mseitunu va kudasi, nondee muunganiswe kuvecha pamwi na makwati gye gasigaliye gya miseituni gye givyalilwe. Mwipata kyakula kuchumbila midadikwa lya misaituni gye givalilwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Suwe, mubihile kuvabeda vala vanu vevadumulwe ngita mikwati! Wuli, mukuvabeda? Nyenye nde mikwati, muwuwike kuva senyenye yemuletila uwumi mumidadikwa, ila midadikwa nde gileta uwumi kwa nyenye.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ila mwilonga, “Mikwati gadumulilwe neke nene ndimatikwe pono lyake.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Mwilonga ndakyene! Vanu avo vakadumulwe kwakuva sevakaidikile, ila veve wikwima kwa ludikilo lwako. Nondee bihile kwidumba, ila uveche na uwogofi. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Kwakuva ngita Nguluvi sevawonela lusungu Vayawudi yevawanine na mikwati gegidumulwe, wuli wihocha daakuwonela lusungu nyenye? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Mulole, Nguluvi peagehe msanzi na mkali. Mwene ndi mkali kwa vala vevileka kumfwata, ila ndi msanzi kwa nyenye ngita damwiendelela kwikala muusanzi vake, ngita semwigita ndeni na nyenye damwidumulwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Ndeni ndeni Vayawudi dasevakumdikila Nguluvi, damwimatikwa kangi, kwakuva Nguluvi iwesa kuvamatika kangi. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Nyenye vanu se Vayawudi ndakyene muwanine ngita mikwati ga miseituni ga kudasi, muhechiliwe ukoya, mukamatilwe mumseituni va kumgunda mdodo, ndakyene sepono lya nyenye. Ila Vayawudi viwana na mseituni vakumgunda, ila ndi upefu kwa Nguluvi kumatwa kangi mulibiki lyawo vavene.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguluvi akuvawonela lusungu vanu vonda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Valongu vangu, nding'ang'a muchele lupwepo ulu, neke mubihile kwihocha mugehe luhala hilo. Usugu va Vayawudi ndi va chipindi chidodo hela, mbaka vanu se Vayawudi davamuwuyile Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ndeni vanu vonda va Isilaeli davikombolwa, ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mlowa daakwacha kuhuma Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">daakuvagita ulelo va Yakobo valeke sambi chawo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ilyi nde lyagano dandigita navo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">dandihecha sambi chawo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Kwakuva Vayawudi vakanile Njowo Chinofu, vene vakali vachundamwa va Nguluvi kwakuva lya nyenye vanu se Vayawudi, ila kwa fwayida lyenu nyenye vanu se Vayawudi. Ila kwakuva Nguluvi akavahaguwe, vakali vakeliwe na Nguluvi kwakuva lya vagogolo vawo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Kwakuva Nguluvi peakuvahagula vanu na kuvafunyila seivesa kubadilisa. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Dahila nyenye vanu se Vayawudi semumdikile Nguluvi, ila nondee muwanuke lusungu lwake, kwakuva Vayawudi vakalemile kumpulikicha Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ila sevakumginya Nguluvi, Ila Nguluvi avechile msanzi hilo kwa nefwe neke Nguluvi aveche msanzi kwa vao. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Nguluvi ilonga kila munu agehe na nongwa kwakuva se vakumpulikicha, Nguluvi ilonga ndeni neke awonese usanzi vake na kumhongecha kila munu.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunjumwe Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ndakyene! Nguluvi nde mkomi hilo mwene agehe na kila kinu, ichela finu fyonda kwihela ye iwesa kuchela peilamula, kwihela munu ye iwesa kulonga ng'asi chake. <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">“Ani yeichela mahocho ga Mtwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Ani yeiwesa kuva myovecha vake?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Awu, ani yealonguwe kumgavila Nguluvi kinu kyokyonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">neke amuhombe?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Kwakuva finu fyonda fiwumbilwe na Nguluvi, na figehe kwakuva lyake. Nguluvi anjumwe mbepali! Ndakyene.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Maisa gya kumlumba Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Ndeni, valongu vangu, kwakuva Nguluvi agehe na lusungu hilo, ndikuvasuka kwa numbula lyangu yonda, muyihechile nyenye vavene muveche usembe veugehe uwumi lya kumkelesa Nguluvi. Nga mgita ndeni nde Ng'asi lya undkyene lya kumlumba Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Mubihile kuhocha awu kugita ngita vanu va inyi iyi, ila mulongele Nguluvi abadilise namna lyenu lya kuhocha mugati lyenu muwese kugachela gala geakela Nguluvi. Baho damuwesa kugachela geakela Nguluvi gala manofu na gegikumkelesa na chitimile.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Kwakuva Nguluvi andigavile usanzi vake, ndeni ndikuvalongela nyenye vonda, mubihile kwiwona kuva nyenye ndi vanu va komi hilo kuchumba pemung'ang'wa kuvecha, ila kila yumwi ayilolele ngita Nguluvi peamgavile kila munu kwa ludikilo lwake. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ngita pemchela mvili ndeumwi ila ugehe fiwungo fyongofu, kila kimwi na kasi lyake. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ndeni ndeni na nefwe tugehe volofu, ila nefwe kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito tuvechile mvili umwi na kila yumwi vetu nde kiwungo kya mweyage. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Suwe, kila munu agavile fupo lya usanzi va Nguluvi, yeagavilwe na Nguluvi umwimike va kuvalonga vanu unanzi va Nguluvi na agite ndeni kwa muludikilo lwake. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Munu yeagavilwe umwimike va kugundamika muleke agundamike. Na munu yeagavilwe umwimike lya kuwulanicha muleke awulaniche unofu. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Munya umwimike va kuvagangamicha vanu vangi na agite ndeni. Munya kumgavila mweyage kyenakyo na agite ndeni kwa numbula yonda. Munu yeavalongocha vanu avalongoche unofu. Munu yeavawonela vanu lusungu, agite ndeni kwa kukeduka.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Muvakele veyenu kwa lukelo va undakyene. Kangi muleke kugita sambi ila mugite manofu chipindi chonda. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Mwikele ngita lukolo na kila munu adoboke hilo kumginya mweyage. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Mugite kasi kwa kugangamala na mubihile kuva vagata. Mumgumbanikile Mtwa kwa numbula chenu chonda. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Mwikeduke kwakuva mukumhuvilila Nguluvi, mwigangamale pemwigudwa na mumsuke Nguluvi figono fyonda. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Muvatange vanu va Nguluviinu finu fyenu fyevisaka, muvawanuke vagenji kwa usanzi.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Muvagitile manofu vanu vala yevakuvagudisa nyenye, muvasukile manofu na mubihile kuvakotola. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Mukeduke na vevigehe na lukeduko, muvembe pamwi na vevavemba. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Mwikale kwa lutengamaso nyenye kwa nyenye. Mubihile kwidumba, ila mwiyidikile kugita kasi na vanu mukuvalola sekinu. Mubihile kwiwona muna luhala hilo.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Munu akikugitila nongwa, bihile kumuhomba unjanganifu. Mugite manofu pautalo lya vanu vonda. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Muyigangamiche kwikala kwa lutengmaso na kila yumwi. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Valongu vangu yendivakeliye, mubihile kumpwisila yeyonda ye akugitile nongwa, ila lukani ulo mulekele Nguluvi muvipo lyake amupulisiye, kwakuva isimbilwe mumasimbo, ilonga Mtwa, “Nene nde ndikuvapilusila vanu” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Ndeni ndeni masimbo gilonga, “Munu yeakuvipila peivecha na njala, mgavile kyakuliya, peivecha na ng'elu, mgavile malenga anyuwe. Kwakuva pewigita ndeni dakumgita apatile nyoni.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Bihile kulutalwa na unjanganifu, ila gawese uwofu kwa unofu.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Umwimike va kulongocha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Kila munu avapulikiche vevakuvalongecha, kwakuva umwimike vonda uhuma kwa Nguluvi na vala vevilongocha nondee vavikilwe na Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Munu yeyonda yeipinja ulongochi apinja lulagilicho lwa Nguluvi na vala yevagita ndeni davahigwa. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Kwakuva vanu vevagita manofu sevavakogopa vanu vevakuvalongocha, ila vala vevagita manjanganifu nde vevakuvakogopa vanu vevakuvalongocha. Ngita wikela ubihile kuvakogopa vene umwimike, gite ganofu na davakunjuma. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Kwakuva vene nde vanjagila va Nguluvi, figita kasi ngajila lya kuvatanga nyenye. Ila pemwigita manjanganifu, muvakogope kwakuva viwesa kuvatova. Vene ndi vanjagila va Nguluvi na viwonesa luvipo lwake kwa vala vevigita manjanganifu. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ndeni, mwing'ang'wa kuvapulikicha vanu vevakuvalongocha, sekwakuva mwimkogopa Nguluvi, ila kwakuva mwichela mwing'ang'wa kugita ndena.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Nde kwakuva nyenye mwihomba kodi, kwakuva vene vakumgumbanikila Nguluvi na viyihechile kwakuva lya kumgundamikila mwene. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Mumuhombe kila munu kyeking'ang'wa kuhombwa munu va kuhombwa usulu na mumuhombe usulu, vakuhombwa kodi na mumuhombe kodi, yeang'ang'wa kuginywa mugavile uginyange.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muyikele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mubihile kuvecha na lideni kwa munu yeyonda, ila muveche na lideni lya kukelana. Yeakumkela mweyage, daivecha aidikile malagilicho ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Malagilicho ndi aga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 13:9">“Bihile kugita ugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 13:9">bihile kudocha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 13:9">bihile kuhicha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 13:9">bihile kudobokela finu fya mweyago.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 13:9">Na chingi chonda, chivikilwe pamwi mulilagilicho ili limwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 13:9">“Mkele mweyago ngita pewiyikela yumwene.”<verse eid="ROM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Munu peakumkela mweyage se akumgitila manjanganifu, ila munu peakumkela mweyage itimisa lagilicho.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Mwigite ndeni, kwakuva mwichela chipindi cha kuhuma mutulo kifikile, kwakuva nondee, ulowa vetu ugehe pepi hilo kuhuma petuvangile kumdikila Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Pamiye ugehe pepi kumala na pamunyi ugehe pepi kumala. Ndeni, tubihile kugita manjanganifu ga kisi na tugite manofu ga welu. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Figono fyonda mwikale kwa uginyange ngita peing'ang'wa kwakuva tukwikala muwelu, sekwa lihungu njanganifu lya kuliya hilo na kugala, sekwa uhafu na ugoni awu kwa ndewo na wifu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Ila muveche ngita Kilisito Yesu, baho muchileke kuchikovekela ludobokelo cha mvili na kugita ludobokelo cha sambi.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Bihile kwihiga nyenye kwa nyenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Muvawanuke vala veneludikilo ludodo na mubihile kwimbinja pe semuvecha pamwi kwa mahocho gyawo. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Vamonga va vanu vakudikila kuva viliya kila kinukwa udikilo vao. Ila vangi kwa wogofi vawo viliya mahamba hela. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Munu yealiya kila kinu abihile kumbeda mweyage sealiya kila kinu. Na yula yealiya mahamba hela abihile kumuhiga yealiya kila kinu, kwakuva Nguluvi amdikiye. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Veve ani umuhige mnjagila va munu yungi? Peigita nongwa awu seigita nongwa mtwa vake nde ichela kuva agitile nongwa, daikwima kwa ukangafu kwakuva Mtwa Yesu iwesa kumukwimicha.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Munu iwesa kuhocha kigono kitunga ndi ngiba kuchumba kigono kingi, munu yungi iwesa kuhocha kuva figono fyonda fiwana. Ndeni kila yumwi na alolele kila kyeakihocha ndi kinofu. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Vala yevahocha kuva kigono kitunga ndi ngiba kuchumba kigono kingi, uyo igita ndeni kwa kwakuva lya kumginya Mtwa, na munu yula yealiya kila kunu igita ndeni kwakuva lya Mtwa Yesu, kwakuva akumuhongecha Nguluvi kwa kyakula kyeamgavile. Yula yeailema kuliya fyakula fingi, igita ndeni kwakuva lya Mtwa Yesu, na mwene akumuhongecha Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Kwakuva kwihela pagati lyetu yeikwikala kwakuva lyake mwene awu yeifuwa kwakuva lyake yumwene. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Kwakuva ngita tukwikala twikwikala kwakuva lya Mtwa na ngita tufuwa twifuwa kwakuva lya Mtwa. Ndeni petuvecha wumi awu kufuwa nefwe nde vanu va Mtwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Kwakuva Kilisito akafuwe na kuchulubuka neke aveche Mtwa va vanu vevagehe wumi na vanu vevafuwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Ndeni, kwa liki veve ukumuhiga mweyago? Na veve kwa liki ukumbeda mweyago? Nefwe vonda datukwima pautalo lya kigoda kya Nguluvi kya kuhigila nongwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Kwakuva ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegisimbilwe, Mtwa ilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Ndikwilapa kwa litawa lyangu, ndakyene ngita pendikwikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">kila munu dakundifugamila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">na kila munu akundijuma kuva nene ndi Nguluvi.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ndeni kila yumwi vetu dahumulila njowo chake yumwene pautalo lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bihile kuvagita vayago vagite sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Suwe, tuleke kuyihiga nongwa, ila tuyilolele, munu abihile kumgitila mweyage agite sambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Nene ndiyiwunge na Mtwa Yesu, ndichela kwa undakyene kwihela kyakula kyokyonda mchilo kuliya, ila munu yeihocha kuva kinu kitunga mchilo kuliya, ndeni iko nde mchilo kuliya kwa mwene. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Ngita peukumpyufisa mlongo vako kwa kyakula kyeuliya, suwe, veve wihela lukelo. Kyakula kyeuliya kibihile kumgita ayage mlongo vako, kwakuva Kilisito akafuwe kwakuva lyake. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Suwe, kila kye mulonga nyenye kuva nde kinofu, kikalongwa na vangi kuva sekinofu. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Kwakuva muung'achale va Nguluvi sekinu kya kuliya na kunyuwa, ila ndi kugita gala gyakumkelesa Nguvi kugita manofu na lutengamaso na lukeduko, fyonda ifi fihuma kwa Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Munu yeakumgumbanikila Kilisito ngita ndeni, akumkelesa Nguluvi na daginywa na vanu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Ndeni, twendelele kugita manofu gegileta lutengamaso na gyegitugita tugangamichwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Suwe, bihile kuhananga kasi lya Nguluvi kwakuva lya kyakula. Fyakuliya fyonda finofu, ila seunofu munu kuliya kyakula kyokyonda kyekimgita munu agite sambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ndi ngiba kuleka kuliya uhuchi, awu kunyuwa difwayi awu kugita kyokyonda kyekimgita mweyago agite sambi. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Nondee veve kila kye ukukidikila mu kyanya lya lukani ulo iveche mugati lyako na Nguluvi. Afunyilwe munu yula yeseakuihiga kwakuva ilola kye igita nde ngiba. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Ila munu yula yeakwihochele kwa kuliya kyakula kyealiya, pealiya dahigwa na Nguluvi, kwakuva munu uyo aidikile agitle kinu se kinofu kwa Nguluvi ngita agitile kyokyonda ambakyo idikila ngajila udikilo ilo nalyo nde sambi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Uvakelese vayago bihile kuyikelesa yumwvene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Nefwe yetugehe vagangamala mukumdikila Nguluvi, twing'ang'wa kuvatanga vala vevagehe na ludikilo ludodo. Tubihile kwiyikelesa vavene. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Kila munu amkelese mweyage kwa unofu neke awese kumgangamicha mu kumdikila Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Kwakuva Kilisito seayikelise yumwene, ila ngita pegilonga masimbo ga Nguluvi, “Maligo gyonda gyevakukuliga veve Nguluvi, nde ndeni vanilige na nene.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Kwakuva gyonda gegasimbilwe pamwandi, gasimbilwe neke kutuwulanicha nefwe, masimbo aga kangi gitutanga kuhuvilila na kutugangamicha neke tuveche na luhuvililo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nguluvi yende akututanga muuhuvilile na kuvecha vagangamala, nondee ndikuvasukila Nguluvi avagite muveche na natilo imwi kwakuva Kilisito isaka mugite ndeni. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />Neke nyenye vonda, mumnjume Nguluvi, Daada va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo Chinofu kwa vanu se Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Ndeni, muyiwanuke nyenye kwa nyenye, ngita Kilisito peavawanuke nyenye neke Nguluvi ajumwe na vanu vonda. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Kwakuva ndikuvalongela, Kilisito akavagundamikila Vayawudi neke awonese Nguluvi peikwidikilwa na jangi yeavikile Nguluvi na vagogolo vetu itimile, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />neke na vanu se Vayawudi vamunjume Nguluvi, kwa lusungu lwake. Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegiloga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ndeni dandikunjuma veve pagati lya vanu se Vayawudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">Dandisomola msambo kulinjuma litawa lyako.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kangi masimbo ga Nguluvi gilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">“Mukeduke nyenye vanu se Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">mukeduke pamwi na vanu vake!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ndeni ndeni gilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">“Nyenye vanu vonda se Vayawudi, mumnjume Mtwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">na vanu vonda mumnjume mwene!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Kangi mvichi Isaya ilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">“Munu yumwi daikwacha mulukolo va Yese</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">na mweme daakuvalongocha vanu va inyi chonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">na vene davakumuhuvilila kuva nde akuvalowola.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Suwe, Nguluvi ndi luvango va luhuvililo, avamemeche lukeduko lyonda na lutengamaso kuhumila na ludikilo lwenu, neke luhuvililo lwenu lihongelege kwa ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasi lya Paulo kwa vanu se Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Vakolo vangu, nene mwene ndidikila kuva mumemele usanzi va Nguluvi na luchelo voyonda na muwesa kwihulanicha mwavene. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Ila ndivasimbiliye nyenye mubaluwa iyi kwa ukakatima, neke ndivawiwuse kangi. Ndigitile ndeni kwakuva Nguluvi andigaviye usanzi. <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />Nguluvi andihaguwe ndiveche mnjagila va Yesu Kilisito kwa vanu se Vayawudi. Ndigundamikila ngita mtekechi kuvadalikila Njowo Chinofu yeihuma kwa Nguluvi neke vanu se Vayawudi vaveche ngita usembe veukumkelesa Nguluvi, usembe veung'alichwe na Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ndeni kwakuva ndiwunge na Kilisito Yesu, kudumbila pendikumgumbanikila Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Kwakuva sendigecha kulonga kinu kyokyonda kugina kila Kilisito Yesu kyeagitile kwa nene neke ndivalongoche vanu se Vayawudi vampulikiche Nguluvi. Kwa gala gyemlongile na kugagita, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />kwa ludali lwa fimanyilo na umanyitu na kwa ludali lya Muhe va Nguluvi. Suwe, mulugendo lwangu, kuvangila kula ku Yelusalemu mbaka Iluliko, kila pono ndikavadalikiye Njowo Chinofu cha Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Natilo lyangu figono fonda ndi kuvadalikila vanu Njowo Chinofu poponda pala litawa lya Kilisito selikapulikike. Ndigita ndeni neke ndibihile kuvanga kangi kasi poono ambalyo munu yungi agitile suwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Ngita masimbo ga Nguluvi pegilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">“Vanu vala sevalongilwe njowo chake davalola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">na vala yesevapulike, davachela.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo ing'ang'a kugendelela ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ndeni kwakuva lya kasi ilyo ndikakanilwe kuvagendelela nyenye. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Ila nondee ndisinda kasi lyangu muinyi ichi, na kwakuva kwa myaka myolofu ndikadoboka kwacha kwa nyenye, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />nondee ndihuvilila dandikuvagendelela pendihelela ku inyi lya Sipaniya na ndikuvasuka munitange kufikila ukoya, ukoya ndandikwikala na nyenye kwa chipindi kidodo na kukeduka na nyenye kisha ndiendelela na lugendo kuhelela ukoya ku Sipaniya. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Ila nondee ndihelela ku Yelusalemu, kuvatanga vanu va Nguluvi vevagehe ukoya. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Kwakuva lipinga lya vanu vevamdikiye Kilisito va ukoya ku Makedoniya na Akaya valamuwe kuhecha muchango vawo kuvatanga vamonga lya vanu va Nguluvi yevali vahangala ukoya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Vavene vakeduke kugita ndeni na ndakyene vakang'ang'ile kugita ndeni. Kwakuva Vayawudi vakali vitang'ana pamwi na vanu se Vayawudi, kwa magito manofu kuhuma kwa Nguluvi kwakuva lya wumi vawo kwa kumkelesa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Pendimalila kasi iyi na kuvagavila Vayawudi muchango vawo, dandichumbila kwa nyenye pendihelela ku inyi lya Sipaniya. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ndichela kuva pendivecha ukoya pamwi na nyenye Kilisito daakuvafunya hilo.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Suwe, vakolo vangu, ndikuvasuka hilo kuchumbila Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito na kwa lukelo lweluhumila na Muhe va Nguluvi, ndikuvasuka mwiwunge na nene kwa kunisukila kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Munisukile ndiwese kuhega unofu kuhuma kwa vala vanu sevamudikile Kilisito yevagehe ku Yudeya na munisukile kasi mu inyi lya ku Yelusalemu idikilwe na vanu va Nguluvi yevagehe ukoya. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ndeni Nguluvi peikela, ndache kwa nyenye na kuno numbula lyangu ikeduka, kwigangamicha pamwi na nyenye. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi yeiletela lutengamaso na aveche pamwi na nyenye vonda! Ndakyene.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Paulo akuvahungila vanu va ukoya ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ndikela kumtambucha kwa nyenye muhacha vetu Foibe, yeagehe mnjagila mu lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito lya ukoya ku Kenkiliya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mumwanuke mwene nave nde mwidikila Kilisto ngita nefwe peing'ang'a kuwanukwa vanu va Nguluvi. Mumtange kyokyonda kyeakela kuhuma kwa nyenye, kwakuva mwene avatangile vanu volofu na anitangile na nene ndeni.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Vahungile Pilisika na mgosi vake ye ikemelwa Akula, vanyegendwa vayangu mukasi lya Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Vene vakaidikiye ata kufuwa neke vaulowe uwumi vangu. Ndikuvahongecha hilo, senene hela, ila ndeni ndeni lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito gyonda ga vanu se Vayawudi vakuvahongecha. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ndeni ndeni vahungile lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito ambavo vevikwilundasa mukaye lyake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Muhungile mganja vangu Epaineto, yealonguwe kumdikila Kilisito ukoya mwani va Asia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Muhungile Maliya yeagitile hilo kasi ngajila lya nyenye. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Muhungile Andiloniko na Yuniya, Vayawudi vayangu yevawopilwe pamwi na nene. Vene vachelwa hilo pagiti lya vanjagila, kangi vakali vanilonguwe nene kumdikila Kilisito.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Kangi muhungile Ampiliato, mganja vangu yendimkeliyekwakuva iwunge na Mtwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ndeni ndeni muhungile Ulibano, mnyegendwa mweyangu mu unjagila va Kilisito, kangi muhungile mganja vangu yendimkela Sitakisi. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Muhungile Apele yeagechilwe na kudikilwa na Kilisito. Muvahungile vonda vevagehe mukaye lya Alisitobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Muhungile lukolo vangu Helodiana, Muyawudi mweyangu na vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito yevagehe mukaye lya Nilikisi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ndikuvasuka Muvahungile Tilufena na Tilufosa vakidala yeavamgundamikile Mtwa na ndeni ndeni muhungile mganja vangu Pelisi, mkidala yungi yeamgumbanikiye hilo Mtwa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Kangi muhungile hilo Lufo, munu yeahaguliwe na mtwa pamwi na maye vake yeakali ngita maye vangu ndeni ndeni. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Muvahungile Asunikilito na Filegoni na Helima na Patiloba na Hema na vanu vonda vevamudikila Kilisito yevagehe pamwi navo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ndenindeni Muvahungile Filologo na Yuliya na Neleya na muhacha vake, Olimpa pamwi na vanu vonda ve vamwidikiye Kilisito vevagehe pamwi navo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ndeni ndeni muyihungile kwa kimanyilo kya lukelo. Muhungilwa na vanu vonda vevamudikiye Kilisito ve vagehe kuno.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilicho ga kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Lukolo vangu, ndikuvasuka hilo, muyilolele na vala yevakuvagita vanu vayinenge, na kuvagita vanu vangi vabihile kugakolela mawulanicho gemuwulanichwe. Mukalenavo patali, <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />kwakuva vanu ngita avo sevakumgumbanikila Kilisito Mtwa vetu, ila vakugumbanikila ludoboko chawo cha mvili. Vanu ava vakuvachanga vanu vasanzi kwa njowo chawo manono na chechikelesa. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kila munu apulike pemukuidikila Njowo nofu, ndeni mukunikedusa hilo. Ila ndisaka muveche na luwala kwa kugita makani manofu na mubihile kuvecha na nongwa kwa kugagita makani manjanganifu. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Na mwene Nguluvi yeakutugavila lutengamaso, dakumubona Setani na kuvagavila nyenye ludali lwa kumwesa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Usanzi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito uveche pamwi na nyenye.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timotewo, mnjagila mweyangu, akuvahungila. Ndeni ndeni Lukio na Yasoni na Sosipateli, Vayawudi veyangu, vakuvahungila.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Na nene Telitio, yendisimbile baluwa iyi ngita Paulo peasakile ndisimbile, ndikuvahungila kwa litawa lya Mtwa.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayo mwenekaye vangu, pamwi na lipinga lya vanu vevamudikile Kilisito lyelitang'ana kukaye lyake, akuvahungila. Na Elasito mvika sendi va mwani ugu na lukolo vetu Kwalito, vonda vakuvahungila. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Ndikuvasukila kwa Nguluvi muveche na usanzi va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito uveche pamwi na nyenye vonda. Ndakyene.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufunyo lwa kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Suwe, nondee tumnjume Nguluvi kwakuva mwene ndi Mkomi! Mwene awese kuvagangamalisa mwime ukangafu muudikilo veuletelwa na Njowo nofu cha Yesu Kilisito, yendikali ndidalika kwa nyenye. Dahila njowo icho sechigubutuliwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Ila nondee, lupwepo ulo igubutulwe na kuchelwa kuchumbila masimbo ga vavichi va Nguluvi na lulagilicho lwa Nguluvi lwa mbepali, yeichelwe kwa vanu vonda. Neke vanu va inyi yonda vamdikile na vampulikiche.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Nguluvi weka munya uginyange vonda, agavilwe njumwa kwa ukomi vake m bepali na mbepali kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito! Ndakyene.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>